cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the 3D-CovDiffusion paper accepted at IROS 2026.
title: 3D-CovDiffusion
type: software
abstract: >-
  Research software for training and evaluating geometry- and
  history-conditioned diffusion policies that generate temporally ordered
  6-DoF coverage-trajectory chunks from raw 3D point clouds. The method targets
  industrial surface processing, including robotic spray painting, spray
  coating, and polishing. Model weights are distributed separately under CC BY
  4.0.
